{"hw":"καταδαρθάνω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">καταδαρθάνω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">καταδαρθάνω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">κατέδαρθον</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-δάρθειν</span> acc. to Sch.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">38</span> </span>), <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">κατέδραθον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">subj.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">καταδράθω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.471</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-δαρθόντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">300</span> </span> (<span class=\"gk\">-δαρθέντα</span> codd.): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">κατεδάρθην</span> is found in later writers, as <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.36</span> </span>, and <span class=\"lex-gram\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pl.</span> <span class=\"gk\">κατέδαρθεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.R.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1227</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">καταδεδάρθηκα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">219c</span